          "title": "You'll want to know: خوشنویسی",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خوشنویسی (khoshnevisi) — \"calligraphy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او سالها خوشنویسی یاد گرفت. u sâlhâ khoshnevisi yâd gereft. He studied calligraphy for years."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "khosh 'fine' + nevis 'writing' (stem of neveshtan) + -i. A calligrapher is khoshnevis."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "khoshnevisi is built on native Persian parts: khosh, 'fine', nevis, the present stem of neveshtan, which EtymDB traces to Middle Persian (EtymDB), and -i: fine writing."
            }
          ]
        },
